[00:24.66] You'll be uncomfortable 40 percent of the time
[00:26.86] When you open the gates of adulthood
[00:29.84] A fair warning, dare I question its accuracy?
[00:36.24] But still, there was much I wasn't told
[00:41.64] And much that wasn't explained
[00:47.82] I decided to venture out seeking answers
[00:54.12] I went to a professional
[00:58.06] "Can you pinpoint the origin of my anxiety?"
[01:02.26] The doctor pulled out a map
[01:07.64] I studied it, and there I saw:
[01:10.92] Envy, bitterness, love, nostalgia, confusion, guilt, and desire
[01:14.54] All illuminated like neon on the perimeters of a bustling thoroughfare
[01:19.94] Soliciting my neurons for their patronage
[01:25.50] Buzzing and pregnant with emotional potential
[01:30.36] Ships docking harbors like thoughts approaching the threshold of perception
[01:35.38] Towns of rapid traffic synapse intersections
[01:38.02] Forests of dense cranial arbors
[01:43.26] I continued studying the map
[01:48.76] "It's here"
[01:52.42] The doctor pointed to an empty patch
[01:55.90] There was one road leading out to an empty patch
