[02:05.14] "Right here?"
[02:06.58] I surveyed the space with my finger
[02:10.32] The doctor nodded gravely
[02:12.98] "I'll leave you with the map for a moment," he said
[02:15.40] Then gathered his instruments and neatly exited the room
